# owl-disjoint-classes: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/owl-disjointWith.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:Cat owl:disjointWith :Dog. :milo a :Cat. :fido a :Dog.

# Inference rules
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.

{?A owl:disjointWith ?B. ?X a ?A. ?Y a ?B } => {?X owl:differentFrom ?Y}.
{?A owl:disjointWith ?B. ?X a ?A. ?X a ?B} => false.
